      "updated": 1776767689535,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. ownPromisifiedTimeout()\n2. new Promise class is returned and constructor get called\n3. Constructor call the fun() that is ->\n4. setTimeout go to Web Api or eventloop\n   and wait for 4 sec.\n5. now sync code run .then()\n6. this.resolve become\n\n\n\n\n\n7. now after 4 sec this.resolve() get called.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. ownPromisifiedTimeout()\n2. new Promise class is returned and constructor get called\n3. Constructor call the fun() that is ->\n4. setTimeout go to Web Api or eventloop\n   and wait for 4 sec.\n5. now sync code run .then()\n6. this.resolve become\n\n\n\n\n\n7. now after 4 sec this.resolve() get called.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
